# WARP-8: Steps' knobs are the picked drum's own four, as EDIT's first page: the same hand tunes a drum from either.
# The steps' scale is Bar's knob 3. A step held on EDIT locks the knob turned
wait 300
listen
expect trk 1
expect page Steps
tapkey b0
expect par1.d1.k1 82
turn K1 3
wait 40
expect par1.d1.k1 85
turn K2 -2
wait 40
expect par1.d1.k2 40
# another drum: its own knobs
tapkey b1
turn K1 1
wait 40
expect par1.d2.k1 80
expect par1.d1.k1 85
# EDIT shows the same four
tap EDIT
wait 40
expect page Engine
turn K1 -1
wait 40
expect par1.d2.k1 79
# Bar: knob 3 the steps' scale
tap SEQ
turn SELECT 1
wait 40
expect page Bar
turn K3 1
wait 500
said SCALE
shot macros_bar.png
turn SELECT -1
shot macros_steps.png
